@dsh-external/dsh-session-recap README · Install：Apply the update through the plugin manager, then reload the page. Restart the host if the manager requests it. Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` is required.

-----

<a id="use-this-package"></a>

@dsh-external/dsh-session-recap README · Configure：A profile patch replaces the whole config for the row. Keys you omit take their schema defaults, so a partial override is enough.

-----

<a id="understand-the-implementation"></a>

@dsh-external/dsh-session-recap README · Understand the implementation：<details>
<summary>Mechanics — click to expand</summary>

The host tracks turn boundaries through a session projection and owns app-wide client presence and continuous away time. Any active or unknown client pauses automatic generation. Automatic calls check the same away period before starting and before publishing; manual calls remain independent of focus changes. See [development notes](docs/development.md) for implementation details.
